<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates widen, one week fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates widen, one week fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight rates widened on Tuesday to 10 and 10-3/8 from Monday's 10-1/8 and 10-3/16 percent in a very short private market that turned liquid after mid-day, bankers said.</p>
<p>Average one week rates fell to 10-1/4 percent from 10-1/16 and 10-3/8 percent on Monday.</p>
<p>State-owned banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
